▼ root (0/4)                  │No command running. Press 'r' to run a command.
├─▼ alpha (0/2)               │
│ ┌────────────────────────────── Keybindings ───────────────────────────────┐
│ │Navigate                              Output                              │
└─│j / ↓       Move down                 c           Copy output             │
  │k / ↑       Move up                   Shift+↑/↓   Scroll output           │
  │h / ←       Collapse / deselect       { / }       Output top / bottom     │
  │l / →       Expand / select           Tab         Type into the command   │
  │Space       Toggle selection          Ctrl+R      Toggle fullscreen       │
  │E           Expand all groups         L           Toggle log panel        │
  │W           Collapse all groups       Other                               │
  │/           Search and filter         ?           Toggle this help        │
  │Run                                   q / Ctrl+C  Quit                    │
  │Enter       Run selected commands     Searching                           │
  │r           Run command or group      Enter       Keep the filter         │
  │s           Stop command              Esc         Clear the search        │
  │x           Clear command             Typing into a command               │
  │g           Select by git changes     Ctrl+]      Back to the tree        │
  │F5          Reload the config         Esc         Back, unless full-screen│
  │                                      Fullscreen                          │
  │                                      Esc         Exit fullscreen         │
